OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome early evening brightness at
OL,7,Ffirst, but thickening cloud heralding
OL,8,Fperiods of rain that reach the western
OL,9,Fcoast late evening, before following
OL,10,Fto all overnight with heavier
OL,11,Foutbreaks in west and strengthening
OL,12,Fwinds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FWet, windy start with the
OL,15,Fchance of some heavier outbreaks,
OL,16,Fespecially in west. Rain progressively
OL,17,Fmore patchy through morning, leading
OL,18,Fto some brighter spells but still a
OL,19,Ffew light showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
