OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,6,Fmainly dry with light winds and
OL,7,Flengthy sunny spells. Monday starting
OL,8,Fmainly dry, soon turning wet and
OL,9,Foccasionally windy. Tuesday showery in
OL,10,Fwest, drier and brighter in east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
